WEBVTT

01:36.679 --> 01:39.724
I guess I'll try this one.

01:42.310 --> 01:43.561
Go!

01:47.899 --> 01:49.859
What? This'll need some adjustment!

01:54.155 --> 01:57.283
Gabby-chan-san,
are there any assailants over there?

01:57.367 --> 01:59.786
Something attacked me.

02:00.453 --> 02:03.123
When did these get inside the manor?

02:03.832 --> 02:05.792
Sounds like you're dealing
with something, too.

02:05.875 --> 02:09.129
Yes. We're currently battling
Daemons I've never seen before.

02:09.838 --> 02:11.756
Well, take care of them already.

02:11.840 --> 02:14.008
I'm currently injured and
have limited mobility.

02:14.092 --> 02:16.636
What?! You're useless!

02:16.719 --> 02:18.263
Isn't Asa with you?

02:18.346 --> 02:19.556
You'd better protect her!

02:20.140 --> 02:22.809
Yuru-san and his Daemons
are taking care of us.

02:22.892 --> 02:24.727
Those guys who kicked my teeth in?

02:25.770 --> 02:26.771
Those bastards.

02:26.855 --> 02:27.981
You'll be perfectly fine, then.

02:28.690 --> 02:31.151
Then I'm free to do what I want, right?

02:31.734 --> 02:33.319
Be my guest.

02:33.903 --> 02:35.363
Got it.

02:38.908 --> 02:40.076
Gobble.

02:47.250 --> 02:48.376
Y'know...

02:49.168 --> 02:52.797
I feel bad about leaving
you all by yourself.

02:53.882 --> 02:54.966
Gobble.

03:11.482 --> 03:13.318
Lucky you, Gabriel.

03:13.401 --> 03:15.695
You get an extra large late night snack.

03:16.362 --> 03:18.615
Gabby-chan-san seems to be fine.

03:18.698 --> 03:21.576
Good. I'm going to stop those.

03:22.493 --> 03:23.620
You can do that?

03:23.703 --> 03:25.163
If I do, can I hug you?

03:25.747 --> 03:27.415
No. You'd probably break my ribs.

03:27.498 --> 03:30.668
Sorry if I wreck the manor, Jin-san.

03:31.252 --> 03:34.172
I'll bear the brunt of the master's rage.

03:34.255 --> 03:38.301
I'm also sorry
if I wreck the manor, Jin-san.

03:38.384 --> 03:40.303
You can bear the master's rage yourself.

03:40.386 --> 03:43.056
This is obvious discrimination!

03:45.350 --> 03:49.062
Brother, could you distract the white one?

03:49.145 --> 03:51.356
Don't tell me what to do. But I've got it.

04:01.991 --> 04:02.825
What?

04:03.952 --> 04:04.786
What?

04:09.582 --> 04:10.792
Asa-san?!

04:10.875 --> 04:11.834
Asa-chan?!

04:13.002 --> 04:14.045
She vanished.

04:15.421 --> 04:18.466
Her brother, too? What did this thing do?

04:18.967 --> 04:20.343
It's running—

04:24.889 --> 04:26.683
I dunno what happened,

04:26.766 --> 04:29.519
but if they can make people disappear,

04:29.602 --> 04:33.189
they might know something
about Asa-chan's parents.

04:37.819 --> 04:40.738
You can damage the manor,

04:40.822 --> 04:43.032
but don't kill them
or their master, Haruo.

04:43.116 --> 04:44.409
Yes, sir.

04:45.410 --> 04:48.371
Haruo, we're surrounded by enemy Daemons.

04:49.622 --> 04:51.791
I need you to handle them, Jin-san.

04:51.874 --> 04:52.792
What?!

04:52.875 --> 04:55.837
I'll be defending Haruo.

04:55.920 --> 04:56.921
What?

04:57.964 --> 04:59.132
Ow...

04:59.215 --> 05:03.636
The master, Natsuki, and Fuyuki
aren't even back yet.

05:04.262 --> 05:05.555
Where's Hagure-sensei?

05:05.638 --> 05:07.807
Sleeping after a deadline.

05:07.890 --> 05:09.976
If you wake him now, he'll kill you.

05:14.522 --> 05:16.399
No reinforcements, then.

05:17.984 --> 05:19.902
Which means we'll just
have to do our best.

05:20.695 --> 05:22.739
Ai-chan, Makoto-kun.

05:24.615 --> 05:27.660
Brother! Brother!

05:27.744 --> 05:30.413
Jin-san! Haruo-san!

05:31.039 --> 05:32.874
Sakurazawa-sensei!

05:32.957 --> 05:35.835
Ai-chan! Makoto-kun!

05:35.918 --> 05:38.337
Torty! Bunbun...

05:44.469 --> 05:45.636
I'm alone...

05:58.107 --> 05:59.734
You're not alone.

06:01.194 --> 06:02.737
My brother's Daemon?

06:02.820 --> 06:05.448
Yeah. I'm the right half.

06:06.657 --> 06:08.701
It's too dark to see anything.

06:08.785 --> 06:12.455
I can't see anything either,
but I'm right by you.

06:13.122 --> 06:16.000
Anyway, this is true darkness.

06:16.084 --> 06:18.920
It doesn't even get this dark
in Higashi Village.

06:19.712 --> 06:21.339
I can't even see
what's right in front of me.

06:23.549 --> 06:25.468
I smell an unpleasant sweat.

06:26.052 --> 06:27.887
Are you afraid of the dark?

06:34.519 --> 06:38.314
I hate being alone in the dark.

06:39.774 --> 06:41.776
You smell like you're around here.

06:43.444 --> 06:45.530
Don't worry. I'm right next to you.

06:46.030 --> 06:47.698
You're not alone.

06:52.078 --> 06:54.497
Brother! Where's my brother?

06:54.580 --> 06:56.582
Is he somewhere inside this space?

06:57.416 --> 06:59.252
I don't smell him nearby.

06:59.836 --> 07:02.004
Aren't you his Daemon?

07:02.088 --> 07:03.840
Why aren't you helping him?

07:04.549 --> 07:06.968
Left's probably with him.

07:07.051 --> 07:08.719
They'll figure something out.

07:09.303 --> 07:12.849
I followed you because I wanted to talk.

07:13.474 --> 07:14.308
With me?

07:15.101 --> 07:20.398
When we first met in the village,
you suddenly attacked me.

07:21.399 --> 07:26.237
And you haven't said a word to me
since I arrived at the manor.

07:27.655 --> 07:31.492
You know I'm your natural enemy,
don't you?

07:35.913 --> 07:41.836
When you countered—no, uh... canceled...?

07:41.919 --> 07:43.296
Canceled?

07:43.379 --> 07:44.505
I'm sorry.

07:44.589 --> 07:46.048
I don't know how to describe it.

07:47.842 --> 07:49.343
Neutralized.

07:49.427 --> 07:54.098
Yeah, when you neutralized my Break,
I remembered.

07:54.182 --> 08:01.105
Father said Right and Left can stop Break
and Seal from getting out of control.

08:01.189 --> 08:03.983
Then that makes things easy.

08:05.318 --> 08:07.487
I am your natural enemy.

08:08.070 --> 08:10.323
Nice to meet you, Asa.

08:10.907 --> 08:16.078
Which means if my brother
acquires the power of Seal,

08:17.163 --> 08:19.957
she'll become his natural enemy.

08:23.169 --> 08:24.837
You're here, Left?

08:25.505 --> 08:28.382
This space is totally empty.

08:28.966 --> 08:31.594
What even is this place?

08:31.677 --> 08:32.762
Who knows?

08:32.845 --> 08:36.807
I've lived a long time, but I've
never experienced this before.

08:37.975 --> 08:40.436
There seems to be a ground,

08:40.520 --> 08:43.523
but this bright white
is making me lose my sense of balance.

08:43.606 --> 08:47.235
While flying earlier,
I ran into a... ceiling?

08:47.318 --> 08:48.778
Above us.

08:49.362 --> 08:55.451
This feels like we're inside
a spherical barrier made by those Daemons.

08:55.535 --> 08:57.703
This is a barrier?

09:00.540 --> 09:02.542
Any enemies around?

09:02.625 --> 09:06.045
I don't sense or smell anyone besides us.

09:06.879 --> 09:10.550
Okay. Help me adjust my aim, Left.

09:10.633 --> 09:11.759
Right now? Here?

09:12.468 --> 09:16.597
I don't know what's going on,
but I don't want to waste time.

09:17.098 --> 09:21.602
Father told me to always
keep my tools in good shape

09:21.686 --> 09:23.354
so I'd be ready to fight anytime.

09:23.437 --> 09:26.857
This confusing situation
doesn't scare you?

09:27.817 --> 09:29.277
Scare me?

09:29.360 --> 09:33.698
Nothing's made any sense
since the village was attacked.

09:34.407 --> 09:37.743
I've gotten used to
being confused by everything.

09:39.036 --> 09:40.204
Poor kid.

09:45.251 --> 09:47.587
Stand there and raise the machete.

09:47.670 --> 09:49.005
That'll be my target.

09:49.088 --> 09:50.423
Like this?

09:50.506 --> 09:51.382
Yes.

09:59.724 --> 10:01.684
Try to dodge them!

10:01.767 --> 10:05.271
But then I'd have to
go pick up the arrows.

10:05.354 --> 10:07.023
Yeah, but still!

10:07.106 --> 10:10.901
Like I said,
I'm made of stone. Don't worry.

10:13.029 --> 10:14.280
I'm sorry!

10:14.864 --> 10:16.657
Something's not right.

10:17.241 --> 10:19.619
Shouldn't you be worried
about your sister?

10:19.702 --> 10:21.704
What? Her?

10:21.787 --> 10:26.083
She was swallowed by the black barrier
at the same time we were.

10:26.167 --> 10:29.128
Doesn't she have the power of Break?

10:29.920 --> 10:33.257
If these are barriers,
then there's nothing to worry about.

10:40.139 --> 10:41.307
What is it, Torty?

10:48.397 --> 10:49.857
We're out!

10:50.483 --> 10:53.194
Ah, so that was their barrier.

10:54.195 --> 10:55.863
Welcome back, Asa.

10:56.447 --> 10:57.531
Thanks.

10:58.574 --> 10:59.575
And now...

11:00.201 --> 11:04.080
I'm going to Break your contract
with your current master.

11:13.172 --> 11:14.090
Asa.

11:15.508 --> 11:19.011
You held onto this after complaining
about how unsanitary it was?

11:20.221 --> 11:21.806
Sorry it's old blood.

11:27.269 --> 11:28.687
You're getting a new master.

11:33.984 --> 11:36.320
Now, I'll be your master.

11:38.948 --> 11:42.034
Wow, they're so friendly.

11:42.910 --> 11:44.703
I wonder what they're called.

11:45.538 --> 11:46.664
Good boy.

11:47.665 --> 11:50.459
We'll be spending some time together.

11:51.460 --> 11:53.421
I need you to do something
for me right away.

11:53.504 --> 11:55.714
Did you swallow my brother?

11:58.384 --> 11:59.885
Spit him out! Spit him out!

11:59.969 --> 12:01.387
Spit him out right now!

12:08.185 --> 12:09.145
They're out!

12:09.228 --> 12:10.229
Brother!

12:13.816 --> 12:16.068
Wait, wait! They're on our side now!

12:16.152 --> 12:17.153
Explain!

12:17.236 --> 12:18.195
What? Uh...

12:18.279 --> 12:22.616
Those Daemons who trapped us inside
those weird spaces are on our side now.

12:22.700 --> 12:25.453
Since they can instantly
make people vanish,

12:25.536 --> 12:29.373
their master might know something
about Asa-chan's parents.

12:31.167 --> 12:34.003
So we're going to go catch them.

12:34.086 --> 12:36.380
Okay. How?

12:37.798 --> 12:39.341
I have another request.

12:40.676 --> 12:44.513
Will you tell me where
your previous master is?

12:46.599 --> 12:49.810
She's making Daemons sell
out their old master.

12:50.311 --> 12:53.105
Teenagers these days really are scary.

12:59.445 --> 13:01.280
Seriously? What an overpowered ability.

13:01.363 --> 13:05.534
I can't believe those idiots
sold me out so easily.

13:05.618 --> 13:07.995
Where are they? It's too dark to see—

13:10.456 --> 13:11.874
Get him, Right.

13:12.458 --> 13:14.335
- Got it.
- Okay.

13:14.919 --> 13:16.420
Who else are we catching?

13:16.504 --> 13:19.673
I just got to witness
how amazing my brother is firsthand.

13:19.757 --> 13:21.717
I'm so glad to be alive!

13:26.472 --> 13:27.723
Jin-san.

13:28.557 --> 13:30.392
My apologies for the commotion.

13:30.476 --> 13:33.103
Non-combatants should remain
hidden in a safe place

13:33.187 --> 13:35.731
until we've taken care of this.

13:37.608 --> 13:39.026
Yes, sir!

13:42.154 --> 13:43.280
That's it.

13:43.364 --> 13:44.698
Keep walking.

13:44.782 --> 13:46.200
We'll blow you up from below.

14:06.345 --> 14:08.514
Okay, job's done.

14:11.809 --> 14:13.978
I don't recognize him either.

14:14.645 --> 14:16.730
Nice work, Jin-chan.

14:16.814 --> 14:21.819
I killed about five groups of wimps
and didn't recognize any of them.

14:22.403 --> 14:24.321
None of them have been
particularly strong.

14:24.405 --> 14:25.573
Right?

14:31.287 --> 14:32.496
Another stranger.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.540
Ow, ow, ow!

14:34.623 --> 14:37.167
Those dentures got my Daemons!

14:37.251 --> 14:38.752
I surrender!

14:38.836 --> 14:40.838
An arrow?

14:41.839 --> 14:43.382
Was that Asa's brother?

14:45.301 --> 14:47.469
Where's he shooting from?

15:00.649 --> 15:02.526
Man, that's scary.

15:02.610 --> 15:07.489
If I take him head on, he'd shoot me dead
before I ever got in range.

15:08.365 --> 15:12.786
They got the others,
so I'm calling it quits.

15:13.495 --> 15:15.831
I'd rather not get hurt.

15:15.915 --> 15:18.292
I should've known
a hastily thrown together

15:18.375 --> 15:20.294
team wouldn't stand a chance.

15:20.377 --> 15:22.087
I'm outta here.

15:25.674 --> 15:27.301
You can't be serious.

15:27.384 --> 15:30.012
I took this job because the pay was good.

15:31.055 --> 15:33.682
Now I'll have to find new Daemons again.

16:11.679 --> 16:13.806
Good work, Jin-san.

16:14.431 --> 16:17.351
That was really tough.

16:18.143 --> 16:21.522
Sorry for dragging you
into this, Mr. Big Brother.

16:21.605 --> 16:23.607
That sure was some way
to entertain your guests.

16:24.316 --> 16:25.359
We appreciate your help.

16:26.193 --> 16:28.612
I didn't do it for you.

16:29.196 --> 16:31.824
I did it to find Mother
and Father's trail.

16:32.866 --> 16:34.576
Asa, you good?

16:38.330 --> 16:39.289
Shitty brat.

16:39.373 --> 16:40.708
Shrimpy brat.

16:41.417 --> 16:43.794
I'll admit I'm a brat,
but I bet I'm older than you.

16:43.877 --> 16:44.795
Liar!

16:44.878 --> 16:47.089
Show some respect to Gabby-chan-sama.

16:47.172 --> 16:51.760
I let you go then,
but I haven't forgiven you.

16:52.594 --> 16:54.513
Rein it in.

16:55.347 --> 16:58.308
Brother and his Daemons saved us.

16:58.392 --> 16:59.268
Yeah, I know.

16:59.351 --> 17:01.645
I can tell.

17:01.729 --> 17:03.272
You caught a bunch of them.

17:07.109 --> 17:09.194
What are we gonna do with them?

17:09.278 --> 17:13.032
We'll have the master decide
once he returns.

17:13.615 --> 17:17.411
For now, let's extract all
the information we can.

17:17.494 --> 17:18.620
Yeah.

17:19.663 --> 17:23.000
They said they'd pay me a fortune
if I captured the twins.

17:23.083 --> 17:26.128
I don't know who they were.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.757
Shall we go with a classic?

17:35.721 --> 17:39.975
It's like a boulder! Oh god, it hurts!

17:40.059 --> 17:42.144
What group put you up to this?

17:42.227 --> 17:43.854
Was it a Kagemori?

17:45.856 --> 17:48.567
I don't know what group!
I really don't know!

17:50.360 --> 17:51.779
It was a one-off job!

17:51.862 --> 17:55.866
I just met everyone on my team
for the first time!

17:55.949 --> 17:58.952
They're probably just average,
ordinary Daemon Wielders!

17:59.036 --> 18:00.621
- You don't know? But someone
- My bones!

18:00.704 --> 18:03.040
- must've been calling the shots.
- You're breaking my bones!

18:03.624 --> 18:08.504
It was some guy with a beard
wearing a camo jacket!

18:11.673 --> 18:15.302
I think I took that guy out
in front of the gates.

18:15.385 --> 18:16.678
Sorry.

18:18.597 --> 18:20.057
Next question.

18:20.766 --> 18:23.060
Do you know the whereabouts
of the married couple

18:23.143 --> 18:24.394
that fled Higashi Village?

18:25.854 --> 18:27.314
They're the twins' parents.

18:27.397 --> 18:30.234
They vanished from a flight to Okinawa.

18:30.317 --> 18:33.862
I don't know anything about them!

18:34.446 --> 18:36.907
Anything might help us find them.

18:36.990 --> 18:38.534
I said I don't know!

18:39.868 --> 18:41.995
I don't know either.

18:42.079 --> 18:43.080
Neither do I.

18:43.163 --> 18:44.665
Do you know anything?

18:48.460 --> 18:51.296
No leads on our parents.

18:51.964 --> 18:55.509
Sorry, Brother. I know you came
hoping to find something.

19:00.597 --> 19:02.933
Anyone else got questions for them?

19:03.684 --> 19:06.436
I do. Could I ask you something?

19:07.062 --> 19:08.730
I'll tell you anything.

19:08.814 --> 19:10.941
Just get this turtle off me.

19:11.650 --> 19:13.652
Tell me their names.

19:14.236 --> 19:15.863
Their names? What?

19:16.989 --> 19:18.740
What do you call them?

19:18.824 --> 19:20.868
Stuff like "hey" and "you."

19:21.451 --> 19:23.453
You should give them proper names.

19:24.037 --> 19:26.373
But they're like livestock.

19:26.456 --> 19:31.128
You gotta show them who's boss
so they don't get carried away.

19:31.795 --> 19:34.882
I'm not trying to be friendly
by giving them names.

19:44.600 --> 19:45.559
Gabby-chan.

19:54.568 --> 19:55.527
I'm gonna go change.

20:00.532 --> 20:02.159
I see.

20:02.242 --> 20:04.953
No wonder your Daemons
sold you out so easily.

20:05.537 --> 20:08.916
Daemons have feelings, too, mister.

20:10.792 --> 20:13.921
If you know anything,
you'd better tell us while you can.

20:14.004 --> 20:16.089
- This was just some job I picked up!
- Same!

20:16.173 --> 20:18.675
And I've named my partners!

20:19.676 --> 20:23.847
Now, what should we call you?

20:25.182 --> 20:30.229
Don't. I'm just your temporary master.

20:30.312 --> 20:32.481
Don't get your hopes up.

20:33.523 --> 20:36.360
Sorry. Could you make
yourselves a little smaller?

20:38.946 --> 20:41.114
So cute! They're so cute!

20:42.824 --> 20:46.495
You said assassins attacked
you one after another after.

20:47.371 --> 20:49.998
Has it been like this
since you left the mountain?

20:50.082 --> 20:53.585
I guess, but this was a lot of guys.

20:53.669 --> 20:55.379
It was a close call.

20:57.714 --> 21:01.009
I'm glad you were here. Thank you.

21:05.055 --> 21:09.434
I let my guard down
because I'd been safe in here.

21:10.060 --> 21:11.687
I should be more careful.

21:11.770 --> 21:15.065
No wonder she's jaded and
scowls all the time.

21:16.400 --> 21:17.317
Your right eye...

21:18.568 --> 21:21.488
Did they take that from you, too?

21:28.912 --> 21:32.207
I guess you could say that.

21:35.335 --> 21:39.339
No, I don't want to lie to you.

21:43.552 --> 21:46.847
You see... I died once.

21:49.141 --> 21:51.143
I was killed
by a Higashi Village assassin.

23:27.614 --> 23:28.907
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:28.990 --> 23:32.244
I felt it penetrating
every pore on my body,

23:32.744 --> 23:37.916
piercing my skin and stabbing
directly into my flesh and organs.
